From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:15:44 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(prompt): runtime markers without the product name;
 optional product help

The runtime block is "# Runtime environment" and the profile line "Active
profile:"; readers still accept the old markers stored prompts carry.
agent.product_help_guidance (true) leaves the Hermes help paragraph out
when false.
